      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": [
        {
          "NlmCategory": "UNASSIGNED",
          "Label": "Summary",
          "content": "In order to help molecular geneticists to rapidly identify CNVs responsible for inherited diseases among amplicons sequencing data generated by NGS, we designed a user-friendly tool ' Cov'Cop '. Using the run's coverage file provided by the sequencer, Cov'Cop simultaneously analyzes all the patients of the run using a two-stage algorithm containing correction and normalization levels and provides an easily understandable output, showing with various colors, potentially deleted and duplicated amplicons."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "UNASSIGNED",
          "Label": "Availability and Implementation",
          "content": "https://git.unilim.fr/merilp02/CovCop."
        },
        {
